                                                "sense_id": "ef592a0c-74c3-3c41-8592-26d64e46a4f9",
                                                "text": "He conferred with Mr. Warren of Plymouth upon the necessity of giving into spirited measures, and then said, \"Do you keep the committee in play, and I will go and make a caucus against the evening; and do you meet me.\""
